  "body": "## What changed\n\nFirst slice of #128: `camcraft-cli mcp`, a stdio MCP server (JSON-RPC 2.0: initialize, tools/list, tools/call) that lets an AI agent drive one document headless, with no GUI and no GPU.\n\n- 17 tools, each with a JSON input schema:\n  - `open_project`, `save_project`, `import_model`, `get_job`\n  - `list_operation_types`, `list_tool_catalog`\n  - `add_tool`, `set_stock`\n  - `add_operation`, `edit_operation` (a JSON merge patch on the `.camproj` param shape; a field the kind doesn't have is refused by name), `delete_operation`, `set_tool`\n  - `undo`, `redo`, `generate`\n  - `verify` (findings as data: op, move, kind, message, whether it blocks; plus the post gate's problems)\n  - `post`\n- Every change is a real command through the document's History, so undo/redo walk exactly what the agent did, and refused commands never enter it.\n- It reuses the job-script engine's document and History, and calls the existing script commands directly, without the JS engine.\n- Errors come back as tool errors, never panics; each call is wrapped so a generator panic becomes a tool error.\n- No new dependency: the protocol is about 150 lines of serde_json. `rmcp` (MIT) was passed over because it pulls in tokio.\n- New `crates/app/src/mcp/` (mod, tools, job, edit) and `project/json.rs`.\n\n## Pins (`tests/mcp.rs`)\n\n- `handshake_and_tool_list`\n- `a_whole_job_over_the_tools`: import STL → stock → tool → Face op → edit → generate → verify → post Fanuc → undo/redo → save → delete → reopen\n- `bad_input_is_a_tool_error_never_a_panic`\n- `the_stdio_loop_answers_line_for_line`\n\n## Readings\n\nmcp 4, cli 7, scripting 17; clippy on app is clean. The real binary answered initialize and tools/list over a pipe.\n\n## Owed\n\n#180 (pick faces, edges and loops), #181 (WCS, machine, fixtures), #182 (sim render and screenshots), #183 (server mode in the GUI).\n\nChangelog: `camcraft-cli mcp`: a stdio MCP server that lets an AI agent open or import a model, set stock and tools, add, edit or delete operations, generate, verify (findings as data) and post - every change undoable\n\nRefs #128\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
